Acts 17:1 , Paul preaches at Thessalonica, where some believe
Acts 17:5 , and others persecute him;
Acts 17:10 , He is sent to Berea, and preaches there;
Acts 17:13 , Being persecuted by Jews from Thessalonica
Acts 17:16 . he comes to Athens, and disputes and preaches the living God, to them unknown;
Acts 17:32 , whereby, though some mock, many are converted unto Christ.
